  "details": "Description\n\nI've been having issue where it seems like my outfit toggles seem to not switch properly when entering a world, with outfits overlaping for everyone else except me, leading me to wonder if it's a bug with Write Defaults being set incorrectly when first loading the avatar. Upon reloading the avatar  but it happens every time I go to a new world. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nUse an int to swap from the default avatar's outfit, only making the clip disable what it needs and then switching worlds, and modifying that toggle in the menu.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-06_17-31-07.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_ea938736-643f-4594-92de-bc664e9014b7/1/file)",
